<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>Imran Daniel</songwriter><songwriter>Joan Pasha Syahputra</songwriter><songwriter>Megat Shazrul Rejab</songwriter><songwriter>Putra Haika</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="00:05:57.630"><div begin="00:00:14.630" end="00:04:13.480"><p begin="00:00:14.630" end="00:00:18.030">Kita tak sama muka surat</p><p begin="00:00:18.030" end="00:00:21.740">Tapi buku sama</p><p begin="00:00:21.740" end="00:00:25.070">Eventho tak habis baca</p><p begin="00:00:25.070" end="00:00:28.650">Kita cuma tahu tajuk</p><p begin="00:00:28.650" end="00:00:31.090">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:00:31.090" end="00:00:35.780">Cerita habis macam mana?</p><p begin="00:00:35.780" end="00:00:38.240">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:00:38.240" end="00:00:44.160">Cerita habis macam mana?</p><p begin="00:00:44.160" end="00:00:47.100">Baby</p><p begin="00:00:47.100" end="00:00:50.770">Aku tau aku bukan sorang je rindu</p><p begin="00:00:50.770" end="00:00:55.080">Banyak problems aku dah terpaksa tadah muka</p><p begin="00:00:55.080" end="00:00:58.010">Malamku sunyi sampai aku rasa biru</p><p begin="00:00:58.010" end="00:00:59.670">Aku buntu</p><p begin="00:00:59.670" end="00:01:01.000">Buntu?</p><p begin="00:01:01.000" end="00:01:05.150">Buntu</p><p begin="00:01:05.150" end="00:01:06.940">Aku buntu</p><p begin="00:01:06.940" end="00:01:12.250">Buntu, oh</p><p begin="00:01:12.250" end="00:01:15.280">Sorok feelings sebab aku tak sure</p><p begin="00:01:15.280" end="00:01:17.280">Benda ni betul ke tak?</p><p begin="00:01:17.280" end="00:01:18.850">Aku nak make sure</p><p begin="00:01:18.850" end="00:01:22.370">But lately malam aku takda bunyi</p><p begin="00:01:22.370" end="00:01:26.570">Kat dalam hati aku rasa sepi</p><p begin="00:01:26.570" end="00:01:29.780">Sorok jiwa aku kat depan kau</p><p begin="00:01:29.780" end="00:01:31.530">Bukan taknak trust kau</p><p begin="00:01:31.530" end="00:01:35.130">Banyak masalah aku takleh pantau</p><p begin="00:01:35.130" end="00:01:38.580">Bukan engkau je sorang yang rindu</p><p begin="00:01:38.580" end="00:01:40.960">Hati aku luka cam time</p><p begin="00:01:40.960" end="00:01:44.420">Kalau sedih aku nak stack up all this bags</p><p begin="00:01:44.420" end="00:01:48.270">Pocket belakang tebal cam buat BBL</p><p begin="00:01:48.270" end="00:01:51.620">Ada hari aku okay rasa cam best</p><p begin="00:01:51.620" end="00:01:54.860">Ada hari banyak petir hujan deras</p><p begin="00:01:54.860" end="00:01:58.300">Kita tak sama muka surat</p><p begin="00:01:58.300" end="00:02:02.070">Tapi buku sama</p><p begin="00:02:02.070" end="00:02:05.430">Eventho tak habis baca</p><p begin="00:02:05.430" end="00:02:08.360">Kau cuma tahu tajuk</p><p begin="00:02:08.360" end="00:02:09.670">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:02:09.670" end="00:02:16.510">Cerita habis cam mana?</p><p begin="00:02:16.510" end="00:02:18.290">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:02:18.290" end="00:02:23.730">Cerita habis macam mana?</p><p begin="00:02:23.730" end="00:02:27.130">Kita tak sama muka surat</p><p begin="00:02:27.130" end="00:02:30.270">Kita tak sama muka surat</p><p begin="00:02:30.270" end="00:02:32.930">Tapi kita sama</p><p begin="00:02:32.930" end="00:02:33.930">Yeah</p><p begin="00:02:33.930" end="00:02:37.840">Tapi kita sama</p><p begin="00:02:37.840" end="00:02:41.330">Kita tak sama muka surat</p><p begin="00:02:41.330" end="00:02:44.690">Kita masih tak sependapat</p><p begin="00:02:44.690" end="00:02:48.290">Tapi soal hati bukan atas kertas</p><p begin="00:02:48.290" end="00:02:52.090">Aku taknak kau yang muka surat lepas</p><p begin="00:02:52.090" end="00:02:55.260">Dan bila kau habis baca nanti</p><p begin="00:02:55.260" end="00:02:58.960">Aku harap kau puas dengan aku</p><p begin="00:02:58.960" end="00:03:02.530">So kalini</p><p begin="00:03:02.530" end="00:03:06.940">Ambilah segala ruang dan waktu</p><p begin="00:03:06.940" end="00:03:13.640">Oh sayang, aku dengan mu</p><p begin="00:03:13.640" end="00:03:20.820">Walau kita tak bersama kau milikku</p><p begin="00:03:20.820" end="00:03:24.870">At least in my head oh baby kita</p><p begin="00:03:24.870" end="00:03:28.280">Tak pernah berpisah</p><p begin="00:03:28.280" end="00:03:35.500">So know that, you're not alone</p><p begin="00:03:35.500" end="00:03:37.340">Perbualan</p><p begin="00:03:37.340" end="00:03:39.000">Yang terakhir</p><p begin="00:03:39.000" end="00:03:42.870">We had that convo dalam kereta at my place</p><p begin="00:03:42.870" end="00:03:49.260">Oh baby ku ingat till this day</p><p begin="00:03:49.260" end="00:03:50.070">Yeah</p><p begin="00:03:50.070" end="00:03:53.470">At the end of the day I need you by my side</p><p begin="00:03:53.470" end="00:03:56.630">All these feelings aku tak boleh nak hide</p><p begin="00:03:56.630" end="00:04:00.200">Smoking on that J we be feeling high as a kite</p><p begin="00:04:00.200" end="00:04:02.030">Promise ending nanti yeah</p><p begin="00:04:02.030" end="00:04:03.700">We gonna be alright</p><p begin="00:04:03.700" end="00:04:06.620">Baby call my phone if you need me</p><p begin="00:04:06.620" end="00:04:08.130">Aku kat sini</p><p begin="00:04:08.130" end="00:04:13.480">Just us two that's 4L sampai mati like</p></div><div begin="00:04:17.340" end="00:05:57.630"><p begin="00:04:17.340" end="00:04:19.040">Yeah</p><p begin="00:04:19.040" end="00:04:20.710">Aku tahu</p><p begin="00:04:20.710" end="00:04:22.460">Kalau kau rindu</p><p begin="00:04:22.460" end="00:04:25.180">Sorry aku copped this LV bag tapi buat aku</p><p begin="00:04:25.180" end="00:04:27.860">Kerna kau bukan milikku</p><p begin="00:04:27.860" end="00:04:28.790">Woah</p><p begin="00:04:28.790" end="00:04:31.270">Kerna kau bukan milikku</p><p begin="00:04:31.270" end="00:04:32.360">Woah</p><p begin="00:04:32.360" end="00:04:35.090">Baju mu masih tertinggal di atas bed</p><p begin="00:04:35.090" end="00:04:40.340">Banyak cewek cantik tapi I know that you paling baddie</p><p begin="00:04:40.340" end="00:04:43.820">I'm thinking bout you all the time but I'm not sad</p><p begin="00:04:43.820" end="00:04:45.020">Stop with the bullshit</p><p begin="00:04:45.020" end="00:04:47.080">I know you still think about me</p><p begin="00:04:47.080" end="00:04:48.870">You think about it prolly</p><p begin="00:04:48.870" end="00:04:50.250">You drink all that bacardi</p><p begin="00:04:50.250" end="00:04:56.060">You tahu you be sad cariku versi kedua</p><p begin="00:04:56.060" end="00:05:01.060">Don't even lie, lie to me</p><p begin="00:05:01.060" end="00:05:04.540">Kita tak sama muka surat</p><p begin="00:05:04.540" end="00:05:08.200">Tapi buku sama</p><p begin="00:05:08.200" end="00:05:11.760">Eventho tak habis baca</p><p begin="00:05:11.760" end="00:05:15.210">Kita cuma tahu tajuk</p><p begin="00:05:15.210" end="00:05:17.870">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:05:17.870" end="00:05:22.430">Cerita habis macam mana?</p><p begin="00:05:22.430" end="00:05:25.180">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:05:25.180" end="00:05:29.710">Cerita habis macam mana?</p><p begin="00:05:29.710" end="00:05:33.340">Kita tak sama muka surat</p><p begin="00:05:33.340" end="00:05:36.920">Tapi buku sama</p><p begin="00:05:36.920" end="00:05:40.210">Eventho tak habis baca</p><p begin="00:05:40.210" end="00:05:43.260">Kau cuma tahu tajuk</p><p begin="00:05:43.260" end="00:05:44.560">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:05:44.560" end="00:05:51.250">Cerita habis cam mana?</p><p begin="00:05:51.250" end="00:05:52.910">Tapi takkan tahu</p><p begin="00:05:52.910" end="00:05:57.630">Cerita habis macam mana?</p></div></body></tt>
